{
    "title": "Screw Puzzle: Wood Nut & Bolt\u2122",
    "description": "Welcome to the Screw Puzzle: Wood Nut & Bolt game, where the world of puzzles meets the thrill of fasteners! Embark on a thrilling adventure where bolts, nuts, and wooden puzzles collide in a mind-bending challenge. Dive into a world filled with conundrums, where every turn reveals a new twist in the game.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Solve the Wooden Puzzle: Conquer the challenge of the wooden stack, untangle bolts and nuts, and unlock the secrets hidden deep within the wood.\r\n\ud83d\udd27 Master the Mechanic Puzzle: Arm yourself with a screwdriver and outsmart wood wasps, overcome the plumer crack obstacles, and avoid the whimsical squirrel nuts.\r\n\ud83c\udf32 Explore the Woods: Venture into the heart of the woods game, where each level brings a new conundrum. Are you ready to delve into the mind-blowing world of Screws & Fasteners?\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\ud83c\udf00 Mind-Blowing Challenges: Get ready for bolts and nuts challenges that will leave your mind blown.\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Wooden Wonderland: Immerse yourself in a captivating woods game with 9 wood-packed levels.\r\n\u2699\ufe0f Nonbinding Fun: Experience nonbinding, thrilling gameplay that keeps you engaged from start to finish.\r\n\ud83e\ude9a Braconids Bonanza: Race through levels, solve the puzzle, and face the legendary Braconids in a fast-paced adventure.\r\n\ud83d\udc3f\ufe0f Screwball Surprises: Encounter unexpected twists and turns as you navigate the wooden enigma - no game wood experience quite like it!\r\n\r\nAre you ready to be \"screwed\" into the ultimate Screw Puzzle: Wood Nut & Bolt \u2013 where boredom is left behind, and the excitement of the game wood awaits? Get set for a riveting journey through a world where nuts, bolts, and puzzles collide!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Screw Puzzle: Wood Nut &amp; Bolt game, where the world of puzzles meets the thrill of fasteners! Embark on a thrilling adventure where bolts, nuts, and wooden puzzles collide in a mind-bending challenge. Dive into a world filled with conundrums, where every turn reveals a new twist in the game.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>\ud83e\udde9 Solve the Wooden Puzzle: Conquer the challenge of the wooden stack, untangle bolts and nuts, and unlock the secrets hidden deep within the wood.<br>\ud83d\udd27 Master the Mechanic Puzzle: Arm yourself with a screwdriver and outsmart wood wasps, overcome the plumer crack obstacles, and avoid the whimsical squirrel nuts.<br>\ud83c\udf32 Explore the Woods: Venture into the heart of the woods game, where each level brings a new conundrum. Are you ready to delve into the mind-blowing world of Screws &amp; Fasteners?<br><br>FEATURES<br>\ud83c\udf00 Mind-Blowing Challenges: Get ready for bolts and nuts challenges that will leave your mind blown.<br>\ud83c\udf33 Wooden Wonderland: Immerse yourself in a captivating woods game with 9 wood-packed levels.<br>\u2699\ufe0f Nonbinding Fun: Experience nonbinding, thrilling gameplay that keeps you engaged from start to finish.<br>\ud83e\ude9a Braconids Bonanza: Race through levels, solve the puzzle, and face the legendary Braconids in a fast-paced adventure.<br>\ud83d\udc3f\ufe0f Screwball Surprises: Encounter unexpected twists and turns as you navigate the wooden enigma - no game wood experience quite like it!<br><br>Are you ready to be &quot;screwed&quot; into the ultimate Screw Puzzle: Wood Nut &amp; Bolt \u2013 where boredom is left behind, and the excitement of the game wood awaits? Get set for a riveting journey through a world where nuts, bolts, and puzzles collide!",
